颜色为青色的节点即为SAM2节点，使用方法为：
第一步，点击New canvas按钮新建画布；
第二步，右键单击空白区域，点击Load Image载入我们要识别的图片，或者复制图片并粘贴到这里也可以（直接拖入貌似不行）；
第三步，添加识别点，按住shift左键单击，可添加绿色识别点，用以确定我们想要识别的主体，按住shift右键单击，可添加红色识别点，用于标注我们不想识别到的区域（注意，目前我还不知道怎么删除识别点，按delete或者backspace键都会删除掉这个节点，而不是删除识别点，所以加点需谨慎，如果谁知道怎么删除识别点，还请不吝赐教^_^）;
第四步，可运行上面的Mask Preview节点查看我们识别的蒙版区域效果如何（小技巧：可右键单击Mask Preview节点，然后点击‘执行选中的输出节点’以单独运行此节点），如果效果不符合要求，可使用Mask Fix节点来修复我们的蒙版。调整到想要的效果后，即可开始我们的重绘部分。

Nodes colored cyan are SAM2 nodes, which can be used as follows:
Step1. Click the New canvas button to create a new canvas;

Step2. Right-click on the empty area and click Load Image to load the image we want to recognize, or copy the image and paste it here (dragging image into it seems impossible);

Step3. Add identify points. Hold down shift left click to add green points to identify the subjects we want to recognize. Hold down shift right click to add red points to mark areas we don't want to recognize. (Note that I don't know how to remove points yet. Pressing delete or the backspace key will delete the node, but not delete the points, so use caution, if anyone knows how to delete the points, please feel free to tell me about it ^_^);

Step4. You can run the Mask Preview node on the right to see how the mask area we identified works (Tips: You can right click the Mask Preview node and click 'Queue Selected Output Nodes' to run this node alone), if the effect does not meet the needs, we can use the Mask Fix node to fix our mask. Once we have the desired effect, we can begin our redrawing part.
